  message: "P3 REVIEW 2026-11-01 (dev 100b6fbb6e; owner-requested re-check of open P3 items last modified before 2026-10-20; fixtures under ~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/p3_review_11012026/misc5/). VERDICT: CURRENT. 2026-11-01 review @100b6fbb6e: is_test_path and is_test_file both return False for packages/hypergumbo-lang-rust-analyzer/recorded/aardvark_dns/crate/src/main.rs. `hypergumbo --backend tree-sitter survey packages/hypergumbo-lang-rust-analyzer` reports rust files=16 test_files=2; the 14 non-test files are all under recorded/. Repo-wide count is unchanged (git ls-files '*.rs' = 19, the other 5 are test fixtures or src/test). WI-dibuf (d3bbf8bdcf) unified the predicates but added no recorded/ rule. Premise holds as filed. MECHANISM: shared test-path predicates (is_test_path/is_test_file) have no rule for a recorded-fixture directory (recorded/). SHARES MECHANISM WITH: WI-ritaf(done)."  # 707b
